  {:id :cue-licence
   :status :adopted
   :at "2026-09-02"
   :raised-by :LA5
   :raised-by-whom "the PRE-RUN REVIEWER (codex-17), not the constructor -- which is the row's own acceptance working."
   :question "A Tension's clauses carry authored literal CUES, and nothing checked that a cue is a word the cited record actually uses. What licenses a cue?"
